From: Daniel Fernau <5053344+danielfernau@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 21:38:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 101/104] Add optional idle timeout for keyboard backlight

When idle.keyboardBacklight is a positive number of seconds, turn the keyboard LED off after that idle and restore the last chosen level on activity. Omit the key or set 0 to leave the light alone. Stay awake and media inhibitors do not pin the LED.

(cherry picked from commit 104b880d5284e9f53e06b354d74061b280a076d3, #12558; the base's newer idle code kept where they conflicted)

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
